{"4442960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Loong Reversi", "steam_appid": 4442960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[A Board Game Epic: 7 Key Features]</strong><br><br><i>Black and White, long locked in conflict within a narrow world, are at last judged by the world itself. On the 50th move, the world expands—and the loong(dragon) awakens. Welcome to a cinematic, grand board-bound epic in the form of Reversi.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[World Awakening] The 8×8 board expands to 10×10 on the 50th move</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Loong Stones] After the board expands, the outer rim becomes “Loong Stones” worth 2 points</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The Smoke] In the additional mode “Battlefield of Smoke,” visibility becomes restricted after the 30th and 50th moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Multi-language] A borderless experience where EN /  TC / JP coexist within a single screen</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The Mythos] A story perfectly aligned with the gameplay—your game completes the myth</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[The Duel] Two-player matches,Beginner, Intermediate, Advanced—and a fierce showdown against the “Master” AI</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[Solitude] No rankings, no trophies—face yourself in the spirit of retro games</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[A Board Game Epic: 7 Key Features]</strong><br><br><i>Black and White, long locked in conflict within a narrow world, are at last judged by the world itself. On the 50th move, the world expands—and the loong(dragon) awakens. Welcome to a cinematic, grand board-bound epic in the form of Reversi.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul clas